/hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hu">Hu</ref> 6; ordal <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IAtr">I Atr</ref> 1,7 = <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 30,6. <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 4,1</dictScrap>
